---

<section class="hero-section">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="eyebrow-wrapper">
      <span class="eyebrow text-alter">[ TOŻSAMOŚĆ KLUBU #01 ]</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero-title">
      SKT PŁAZIK. EKIPA Z <span class="highlight">ZIELONEGO SZLAKU.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-description">
      Jesteśmy studenckim klubem turystycznym dla tych, którym nie chce się siedzieć w miejscu. Organizujemy wędrówki, obozowiska i rajdy, na których liczy się błoto na butach i wieczorne gadanie przy świetle czołówki. Dołącz do stada!
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/dolacz" class="btn btn-primary">Chcę dołączyć -></a>
      <a href="/harmonogram" class="btn btn-secondary">Zobacz harmonogram</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-image">
    <div class="polaroid">
      <div class="image-placeholder">
        <img
            src="https://i.natgeofe.com/k/8fa25ea4-6409-47fb-b3cc-4af8e0dc9616/red-eyed-tree-frog-on-leaves-3-2.jpg"
            alt="Ekipa Płazika na szlaku"
            width="600"
            height="500"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="polaroid-caption text-alter">
        RYS 1: Ekipa w swoim żywiole
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .hero-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .hero-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .eyebrow-wrapper {
    background-color: var(--c-surface);
    border: 2px solid var(--c-outline-h);
    padding: 0.25rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-distance) var(--shadow-distance) 0 var(--c-shadow-hard);
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--c-secondary);
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--c-outline-h);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-wrap: balance;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .highlight {
    background-color: var(--c-secondary);
    color: var(--c-surface);
    padding: 0 0.5rem;
    display: inline-block;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-distance) var(--shadow-distance) 0 var(--c-shadow-hard);
    transform: rotate(1deg);
  }

  .hero-description {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--c-outline-h);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 550px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--c-outline-h);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-distance) var(--shadow-distance) 0 var(--c-shadow-hard);
    transition: transform 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.1s ease, outline-offset 0.1s ease;
  }

  .btn:active {
    transform: translate(var(--shadow-distance), var(--shadow-distance));
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--c-shadow-hard);
  }

  .btn:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px dashed var(--c-outline-h);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background-color: var(--c-secondary);
    color: var(--c-surface);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background-color: var(--c-surface);
    color: var(--c-outline-h);
  }

  .hero-image {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .polaroid {
    background-color: var(--c-surface);
    border: 3px solid var(--c-outline-h);
    padding: 1rem 1rem 1.5rem 1rem;
    box-shadow: calc(var(--shadow-distance) * 2) calc(var(--shadow-distance) * 2) 0 var(--c-shadow-hard);
    transform: rotate(3deg);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .polaroid:hover {
    transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1.02);
  }

  .image-placeholder img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 6 / 5;
    display: block;
    border: 2px solid var(--c-outline-h);
  }

  .polaroid-caption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--c-secondary);
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>